WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
Guile Rushes toward standing Manon.

2
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.550
Standing medium punch starts the confirm.

3
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.350
Down-forward heavy kick links against the standing opponent.

4
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.450
OD Sonic Boom starts its corner juggle.

5
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:03.900
Heavy Flash Kick catches the launched opponent.

6
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.650
Guile cancels into low-health Crossfire Somersault.

7
00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:08.750
The Critical Art continues its finishing sequence.

8
00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:09.200
Manon falls after the Critical Art.
